      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "FIX: responseFormat explicitly set to 'text' so a successful fetch always lands in a 'data' property, which is what HTML Extract Links reads from by default. Before, format was unset, so JSON-responding or odd sites didn't produce a 'data' field at all."
